title: "Installer destination lifecycle"
---
stateDiagram-v2
  state "Legend" as legend {
    lg0: Done
    lg1: In progress
  }
  class lg0 teal
  class lg1 blue
  s0: Waiting to check, destination unchanged
  s1: Checking destinations, destination unchanged
  s2: Ready to install, destination unchanged
  s3: Installed, destination changed
  [*] --> s0
  s0 --> s1: check all destinations
  s1 --> s2: approve install
  s2 --> s3: install approved files
  class s0 blue
  class s1 blue
  class s2 blue
  class s3 teal
